{"parse":{"title":"Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks","pageid":430077,"revid":2088982,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1b/Constellation_Radiance_Over_Blossoms_and_Peaks.png/revision/latest?cb=20260114205227\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1b/Constellation_Radiance_Over_Blossoms_and_Peaks.png/revision/latest?cb=20260114205227\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1b/Constellation_Radiance_Over_Blossoms_and_Peaks.png/revision/latest?cb=20260114205227 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1b/Constellation_Radiance_Over_Blossoms_and_Peaks.png/revision/latest?cb=20260114205227 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Radiance_Over_Blossoms_and_Peaks.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">-</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Not_in_Lone_Splendor\" title=\"Not in Lone Splendor\">Not in Lone Splendor</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unleashing her Elemental Skill <b><a href=\"/wiki/Eternal_Tides\" title=\"Eternal Tides\">Eternal Tides</a></b> will immediately trigger an effect equivalent to the effect of <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\"><b>Gravity Interference</b></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Gravity Ripple</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">After unleashing Elemental Skill Eternal Tides, Columbina will summon Gravity Ripple.<br />Gravity Ripple will follow the current active character on the field, while continuously dealing <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>AoE Hydro DMG</b></span> to surrounding opponents.<br /><br />Additionally, while Gravity Ripple is on the field, and nearby party members trigger Lunar reactions or inflict Lunar Reaction DMG, Columbina will gain the New Moon's Omen effect for 2s, continuously accumulating Gravity. 20 Gravity can be accumulated every 2s.<br />You can have up to 60 Gravity, and it will be removed when the duration of Gravity Ripple ends.<br />Once Gravity is accumulated to its limit, a special Gravity Interference will be triggered. Different effects will be triggered depending on the Lunar reaction type that has accumulated the most Gravity for Columbina. If the Lunar reaction type that has accumulated the most Gravity for Columbina is:<ul><li> Lunar-Charged: Gravity Interference will deal a single instance of <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro AoE DMG</b></span>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Charged DMG.</li><li>Lunar-Bloom: Gravity Interference will fire 5 Moondew Sigils at surrounding opponents, dealing <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>Dendro DMG</b></span>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Bloom DMG.</li><li>Lunar-Crystallize: Gravity Interference will deal a single instance of <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo AoE DMG</b></span>. This DMG is considered Lunar-Crystallize DMG.</li></ul></span></span></span>. This effect can be triggered once every 15s.<br /><b>Moonsign: Ascendant Gleam</b><br />When Gravity Interference is triggered, if the Lunar reaction type that has accumulated the most Gravity for Columbina is:<ul><li><b>Lunar-Charged</b>: Your current active character will recover 6 <a href=\"/wiki/Energy\" title=\"Energy\">Energy</a>.</li><li><b>Lunar-Bloom</b>: Your active character's <a href=\"/wiki/Interruption_resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Interruption resistance\">interruption resistance</a> will be increased for 8s.</li><li><b>Lunar-Crystallize</b>: Summons a <b>Rainsea Shield</b>. The Rainsea Shield's DMG absorption is based on 12% of Columbina's Max <a href=\"/wiki/HP\" title=\"HP\">HP</a>, and it will absorb <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b>Hydro DMG</b></span> with 250% effectiveness for 8s.</li></ul><br />All nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Party\" title=\"Party\">party</a> members' Lunar Reaction DMG is <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\"><b>elevated</b></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Elevation</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects.</span></span></span> by 1.5%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Max_HP\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Max HP\">Max HP</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Generation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Generation\">Energy Generation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Interruption_Resistance\" title=\"Interruption Resistance\">Interruption Resistance</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shield\" title=\"Shield\">Shield</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Charged_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Charged DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Charged DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Bloom_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Bloom DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Bloom DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar-Crystallize_DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lunar-Crystallize DMG Elevation\">Lunar-Crystallize DMG Elevation</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/DMG_Elevation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DMG Elevation\">DMG Elevation</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_1_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 1 Constellation\">Level 1 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiance_Over_Blossoms_and_Peaks%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>As the appropriate Lunar reaction type of the instant Gravity Interference effect is not guided by the gradual accumulation of Gravity through normal combat, it is instead determined directly based on the Elemental Types of characters in the party. When there is a majority of <span class=\"text-electro\"><b>Electro</b></span>, <span class=\"text-dendro\"><b>Dendro</b></span> or <span class=\"text-geo\"><b>Geo</b></span> characters (with a fixed tie-breaker priority in this same order), the instant Gravity Interference will behave as if that respective element's Lunar reaction type had accumulated the most Gravity.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiance_Over_Blossoms_and_Peaks%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">遍照花海，隐入群山</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Biànzhào Huāhǎi, Yǐnrù Qúnshān</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Illuminating the Sea of Flowers Everywhere, Hiding Within the Clustered Mountains</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">遍照花海，隱入群山</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Biànzhào Huāhǎi, Yǐnrù Qúnshān</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">花照らし峰に隠れ入る光</span><br /><small><i>Hana Terashi Mine ni Kakure Hairu Hikari</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">꽃바다를</span> <span lang=\"ko\">품은</span> <span lang=\"ko\">산속의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">달</span><br /><small><i>Kkotbadareul Pumeun Sansogui Dal</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Un haz que ilumina las flores y las monta<span lang=\"es\">ñ</span>as</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Radiance sur les fleurs, au c<span lang=\"fr\">œ</span>ur des sommets</td><td>Radiance Over Blossoms, at the Heart of the Summits</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Сияние</span> <span lang=\"ru\">над</span> <span lang=\"ru\">цветами</span> <span lang=\"ru\">и</span> <span lang=\"ru\">вершинами</span><br /><small><i>Siyaniye nad tsvetami i vershinami</i></small></td><td>Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks</td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Chiếu Sáng Biển Hoa, Ẩn Mình Giữa Núi</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Strahlkraft <span lang=\"de\">ü</span>ber Bl<span lang=\"de\">ü</span>ten und Gipfeln</td><td>Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Radiance Over Blossoms and Peaks</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Resplendor Sobre Flores e Picos</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td><span lang=\"tr\">Ç</span>i<span lang=\"tr\">ç</span>eklerin ve Tepelerin Par<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>lt<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>s<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Bagliore su fiori e cime</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiance_Over_Blossoms_and_Peaks%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/Luna_IV\" title=\"Version/Luna IV\">Version \"Luna IV\"</a></b></div><div>[<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Radiance_Over_Blossoms_and_Peaks/Change_History?action=edit&amp;preload=Template:Change_History/Preload&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=%22Luna+IV%22&amp;preloadparams%5b%5d=Radiance+Over+Blossoms+and+Peaks\">Create New History</a>]</div></div></div><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation\">Navigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRadiance_Over_Blossoms_and_Peaks%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"navbox-border navbox\" style=\"border-spacing:0;;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"nowraplinks mw-collapsible navbox-inner\" style=\"border-spacing:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\";\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><div class=\"hidden\" style=\"float:left;width:6em;text-align:left\">&#160;</div><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size:110%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talents</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Constellation\" title=\"Constellation\">Constellations</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Columbina\" title=\"Columbina\">Columbina</a></span></th></tr><tr style=\"height:2px;\"><td></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0px;text-align: center;;;\" class=\"navbox-list navbox-odd\"><div style=\"padding:0em 0.25em\">\n<table width=\"100%\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; vertical-align: top;\">\n<tbody><tr style=\"vertical-align: top;\">\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Normal </small><br /><b>Attack</b><br /><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moondew_Cascade\" title=\"Moondew Cascade\"><img alt=\"Catalyst Hydro\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Catalyst Hydro.png\" data-image-key=\"Catalyst_Hydro.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/77/Catalyst_Hydro.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/60?cb=20210607091618\" /></a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Moondew_Cascade\" title=\"Moondew Cascade\">Moondew Cascade</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><small>Elemental </small><br /><b>Skill</b><br /><span class=\"mw-defau